"╭ Home ──────────── Monday, October 5 2026 (today) ──────────────────╮"
"│1.╭ Options ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮  │"
"│  │   A command to open notes files with, like nvim. Leave it    │  │"
"│  │   empty for todoro's own editor.                             │  │"
"│  │                                                              │  │"
"│  │ Keys                                                         │  │"
"│  │ Keybindings: unavailable                                     │  │"
"│  │   Your own keys for the list and the leader menu. Enter to   │  │"
"│  │   edit them in your editor; the first time, todoro writes    │  │"
"│  │   the file with every default, commented out.                │  │"
"│  │                                                              │  │"
"│  │ Data                                                         │  │"
"│  │ Todoro folder: ~/todoro                                      │  │"
"│  │   Where every workspace is kept. Enter to move them all to   │  │"
"│  │   another folder.                                            │  │"
"│  │                                                              │  │"
"│  │ Delete                                                       │  │"
"│  │ Delete all items and notes in Home                           │  │"
"│  │   Every day's items, and their notes files. The workspace    │  │"
"│  │   stays, empty.                                              │  │"
"│  │   This can't be undone. Type Home to confirm:                │  │"
"│  │   › Ho                                                       │  │"
"╰──╰─────── j/k move · space toggle · / search · esc close ───────╯──╯"
" OPTIONS   j/k move  space toggle  / search  esc close                "
